Adaptive Gaussian FWI conversion
The exact-velocity SEG-Y was decoded to float32 m/s, arranged as [depth, x],
and stored as data/bp_salt.npy. All 1911 x 5395 velocities agree with the
original SEG-Y. The experiment area-resamples this array in memory to a
70 x 70 synthetic grid; the resampled field is saved in each run archive.
